- Add dynamic bar sizing (DockBarMetrics.GetDynamicSize) and perpendicular slide-in ribbon panel in MainWindow.xaml.
- Update docs/plan/ESTADO.md to close H-E3-07 and E4 (422/422 tests passing, Release/Debug clean).

Refs: RF01, RF02, RF03, HU03 (CA #1, CA #2), E4-CA1..E4-CA7, Q-07, Q-10, Q-11, Q-13, H-E3-07, ADR-005